# Working material lives on this machine's disk and is never committed: the
# agent guides, the development notes, the course report, the plans. What the
# repository does publish from docs/ is the design record — the dated specs
# under docs/superpowers/specs/ and docs/cli-backends.md, both already tracked,
# which a tracked file's immunity to this list is what keeps in.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
# Checks the guides' own numbers against the code, so it only means anything
